  "note": "gfx950 MI355X, bf16 fwd, has_weight only. This closes the half of @Reviewer's blocker that the computed 2->1 VGPR-capacity step was arithmetic rather than an observation: the step is now measured. Two guards run on every row and abort the probe rather than publish -- the wave64->rocprof VGPR relation, and the dispatch count behind the positional width recovery. MAX_N was raised in-process for the probe only; the shipped cap is unchanged.",
